message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "record-conditioned-gravity: a sourcing law, its computational check, and its testability under realistic conditions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Swanson
    given-names: "David T."
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-01"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/davidtswanson903/record-conditioned-gravity"
keywords:
  - semiclassical gravity
  - Schrodinger-Newton
  - self-gravity
  - decoherence
  - optomechanics
abstract: >
  A standalone, reproducible package for a record-conditioned sourcing law for semiclassical
  gravity: the law in closed form, a computational check against the idealized theory it is drawn
  from, and a realistic-conditions feasibility study for testing it on real optomechanical
  platforms. Every number, table and figure a paper would use is produced by this repository in a
  form that can be included directly.
